anizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-02-20T01:17:16Z","updated_at":"2025-02-20T23:18:07Z","closed_at":"2025-02-20T23:18:07Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-15456](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-15456)\r\n### Description\n\nApplying this\n\n```diff\ndiff --git i/src/postgres/src/test/regress/sql/yb.orig.tablegroup.sql w/src/postgres/src/test/regress/sql/yb.orig.tablegroup.sql\nindex 9ffab04bd1..6c7ff3a388 100644\n--- i/src/postgres/src/test/regress/sql/yb.orig.tablegroup.sql\n+++ w/src/postgres/src/test/regress/sql/yb.orig.tablegroup.sql\n@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@\n+SELECT 1;\n --\n -- YB_TABLEGROUP Testsuite: Testing Statments for TABLEGROUP.\n --\ndiff --git i/src/postgres/src/test/regress/sql/yb.orig.tablegroup_dml.sql w/src/postgres/src/test/regress/sql/yb.orig.tablegroup_dml.sql\nindex d2b3261a2b..cea6fdd9a8 100644\n--- i/src/postgres/src/test/regress/sql/yb.orig.tablegroup_dml.sql\n+++ w/src/postgres/src/test/regress/sql/yb.orig.tablegroup_dml.sql\n@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@\n+SELECT 1;\n --\n -- Tablegroups\n --\n```\n\nand running `./yb_build.sh fastdebug --gcc11 --java-test TestPgRegressTablegroup --sj` gives\n\n```\njava.lang.AssertionError: pg_regress exited with error code: 1, failed tests: []\n```\n\nNormally, test names are listed in `failed tests: []`.  This is broken because the `failedTestLineRe` doesn't handle `.`.  This issue has existed for a long time (since commit b7c49abdd60bc5661ed94c5d794ffdbff98e6b70), and it only got worse since commit b7b7cf040343733f98f057bb3af7194052ee30b9 renamed many tests to have `.`.  But such tests with `.` existed even before b7b7cf040343733f98f057bb3af7194052ee30b9, such as `yb.port.collate.icu.utf8` (previously named `yb_pg_collate.icu.utf8`).\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [x] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-15456]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-15456?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"jasonyb","id":93959687,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZm2Bw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93959687?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb","html_url":"https://github.com/jasonyb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/26129/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/26129/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}